      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fries%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every August, Fries hosts the Old‑Time Fiddlers’ and Bluegrass Convention, celebrating the region’s enduring bluegrass heritage.",
